  "sourceTitle": "Pork Tenderloin In Mushroom Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Pork Tenderloin In Mushroom Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 24, 2009 - 11:40pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 lbs. pork tenderloin\n1 teaspoon salt\n1/4 teaspoon pepper\n1/4 cup flour\n3 tablespoons butter\nJuice of one lemon\n1 cup thin cream\n2/3 cup sliced mushrooms\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Slice tenderloin in rounds about 1 inch thick and flatten with a cleaver, rub with salt, pepper and flour. Brown in butter over low heat for 15 minutes. Add remaining ingredients and simmer 20 minutes.",
